{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "noellesroles:mermaid",
      "tab": "ROLE",
      "sourceModId": "noellesroles",
      "nameKey": "announcement.role.mermaid",
      "summaryKey": "guidebook.sparkassist.content.role.overview",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "quote",
              "text": "你在水中如鱼得水！"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "好人阵营的地图专属身份。一碰到水你就会变得灵活许多，离开水后和普通乘客没有区别。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "能力",
              "tone": "info"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "runs": [
                {
                  "text": "如鱼得水",
                  "tone": "info"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：接触水时获得海豚的恩惠和夜视，游得更快、在水下也看得清。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "在水中时，疾跑体力和氧气都能撑到平时的 4 倍（消耗降低 75%）。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "玩法建议",
              "tone": "good"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "被追时往水里跑：你游得更快、憋气更久，追兵很难跟上。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "水下有夜视，适合躲藏和观察。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "需要注意",
              "tone": "danger"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "一离开水，所有加成就会消失。"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "鲛人只在特定地图出现。",
              "tone": "muted"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "ownerRoleIds": [],
      "requiredModIds": [
        "noellesroles"
      ],
      "color": "#0096B4",
      "order": 224
    }
  ]
}
